# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository. Without this, files the .NET
# tooling writes with CRLF (project files, launchSettings.json) sit alongside LF files,
# and any editor that rewrites one produces a whole-file diff for a one-line change —
# which is exactly how a three-key addition to appsettings.json turned into a 30-line
# diff during slice 2.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Checked-in binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
